{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824050/extras/772448dde4e0dbfd322370881a667af8.avif?t=1774466075\" width=1280 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings Pilot!\u00a0 Your Emperor needs you now more than ever.\u00a0 Our glorious Empire established peace and order across the galaxy, but there are those that have rejected our peaceful ways.\u00a0 Rebellions have broken out from every corner that threaten to destroy everything we have achieved.\u00a0 It is up to you, our brave and loyal Citizen, to put an end to this crisis, and Crush The Rebellion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824050/extras/b591356e06b59d6a46438635a91aaf11.avif?t=1774466075\" width=1280 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your orders are simple, coming directly from His Magnificence, our Emperor.\u00a0 We need you to engage the rebel scum head-on and destroy each and every last ship that dares to oppose us.\u00a0 We have given you the best training, the best ship, and the best weapons - this should be everything you need to serve your Emperor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824050/extras/7d1cffda7d5cdd6fa48a237217b8ddaa.avif?t=1774466075\" width=1280 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All who serve our noble cause are worthy of becoming Heroes Of The Empire.\u00a0 As news of your victories spread across the galaxy, new options will open up to customise your ship and purchase new weapons.\u00a0 Use these abilities to maximise your destructive potential!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824050/extras/2d7b7b865d12df5854471625a0fa8045.avif?t=1774466075\" width=1280 height=180 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves of space shooter action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based ship movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of rebel ships to fight, each with their own attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship and weapon upgrades to stay in the fight for longer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon loadout customisation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards - compete to achieve the best score!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824050?t=1774466075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824050/7468f1d63d069c23e7a5289b535352b1601d5d2e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774466075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824050/8f92d269e91f533ff757a901a0c6f9823fa839bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774466075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824050/8f92d269e91f533ff757a901a0c6f9823fa839bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774466075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3824060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_